{"type":"message","id":"794f5c2c","parentId":"3d4d21f7","timestamp":"2026-07-03T13:48:17.061Z","message":{"role":"user","content":"什么 问题发给我","timestamp":1783086494926}}
{"type":"message","id":"f7f1401d","parentId":"794f5c2c","timestamp":"2026-07-03T13:48:23.544Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]\n不好意思，刚才问得太多了。把问题精炼成两个，你好答：\n\n**Q1：飞书任务清单怎么分？**\n- A. **每 agent 一个清单**（推荐：tts 有 tts 的、director 有 director 的…谁的事谁认领）\n- B. 一个总清单「Agent Cron Jobs」（所有任务挤一起）\n\n**Q2：同步触发点？**\n- A. **cron 跑完立刻调飞书 API 勾选**（实时、要改 cron 提示词）\n- B. main **每天汇总一次**批量勾选（轻量、有当天延迟）\n\n---\n\n这两个一拍板，剩下两个（同步范围、勾选节奏）我按推荐默认走就行：\n- 范围：**只同步当前在跑的**，历史不补\n- 勾选：选 A 就实时勾，选 B 就每日勾\n\n**A1 + A2 是我的推荐组合**——每 agent 独立清单 + cron 跑完即勾。\n\n你回\"A1+A2\"或者\"组合一\"我就开干。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":55272,"output":225,"cacheRead":242,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":55739,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783086497070,"responseId":"0696f0a1005a77e9de2ec98d6ebc7db0","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
