{"type":"message","id":"ff108c1e","parentId":"e99e1c51","timestamp":"2026-07-03T13:50:38.091Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]\n好。**A1 + A2 锁定。** 我现在开干。\n\n按 SOUL 边界——改 agent 配置的事归 `agent-orchestrator`。我让 ta 出一份执行清单再动手。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_l4m9l37rjzbu_1","name":"update_plan","arguments":{"plan":[{"step":"让 agent-orchestrator 出一份可执行清单（清单创建 / cron 改写 / 飞书 Task 集成点 / 回滚方案）","status":"in_progress"},{"step":"等 HALEI 看清单拍板后，逐 agent 落地","status":"pending"},{"step":"落地后跑一次端到端验证（改一条 cron → 看飞书任务是否被勾选）","status":"pending"}]}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":761,"output":218,"cacheRead":55026,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56005,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783086634122,"responseId":"0696f12a15eed8a417478d0d87a21643","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
{"type":"message","id":"81936cb2","parentId":"ff108c1e","timestamp":"2026-07-03T13:50:38.259Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_l4m9l37rjzbu_1","toolName":"update_plan","content":[],"details":{"status":"updated","plan":[{"step":"让 agent-orchestrator 出一份可执行清单（清单创建 / cron 改写 / 飞书 Task 集成点 / 回滚方案）","status":"in_progress"},{"step":"等 HALEI 看清单拍板后，逐 agent 落地","status":"pending"},{"step":"落地后跑一次端到端验证（改一条 cron → 看飞书任务是否被勾选）","status":"pending"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1783086638250}}
{"type":"message","id":"7eb92f6a","parentId":"81936cb2","timestamp":"2026-07-03T13:50:50.028Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_zbl9h8dpdzhe_1","name":"sessions_send","arguments":{"agentId":"agent-orchestrator","message":"【任务】HALEI 拍板 A1+A2：每 agent 一个飞书清单 + cron 跑完实时勾选。请你出一份**可执行清单**（不要直接动手，先出方案）。\n\n## 业务背景\nHALEI 不再要 cron 完成推送通知，改为同步到飞书任务清单。每天 agent 跑的 cron job 都能在飞书任务里看到、执行一个勾选一个、失败保持 open 人工追。\n\n## 已锁定的方向\n- **A1：每 agent 一个飞书清单**（tts / content / koc / traffic / ops / director / finance / review / main / agent-orchestrator）\n  - 清单命名建议：「[agent中文名] 每日任务」（如「TK 选品大师 每日任务」「KIIT 每日任务」）\n- **A2：cron 跑完实时调飞书 API 勾选**\n  - 走 `feishu_task_task` 工具（patch action + completed_at）\n  - 失败的任务保持 open（不勾选），不主动通知\n\n## 你的输出要求\n\n请给出一份**可执行清单**，至少覆盖：\n\n1. **盘点**：当前所有 agent 的 cron job 列表（cron list + 按 agent 分组），每个 cron 的 jobId / 名字 / 调度 / 提示词大小（避免重复踩 v7.0 context overflow 的坑）\n2. **飞书清单创建方案**：\n   - 每个 agent 一份清单，谁建、用什么 token（user 还是 tenant）\n   - 任务命名规范（例：「tts 越南 9:00 选品 v8.0」）\n   - recurring 任务还是每天新建？看 API 支持情况\n3. **cron 提示词改写方案**：\n   - 在每条 cron 末尾追加一段「飞书同步指令」：包含「调 feishu_task_task patch，task_guid=xxx, completed_at=ISO 时间」\n   - 提示词膨胀风险评估（v7.0 ~1.5KB 翻车过，目标控制在 1.6KB 以内）\n   - 失败兜底：cron 自身崩溃时，怎么确保飞书任务不被误勾\n4. **通知停掉的范围**：\n   - `delivery.mode` 改什么（announce / none / webhook）\n   - 是否保留 failed 告警\n5. **里程碑**：\n   - M1：方案拍板\n   - M2：先在 1 个 agent 试点（建议 tts，cron 最活跃、验证最充分）\n   - M3：全量铺开\n6. **回滚**：方案不行的兜底（cron 提示词怎么快速还原）\n\n## 边界提醒\n- 你只动 agent 配置相关的代码 / 文件 / cron\n- 不动业务数据\n- 改完任何 agent 的 SOUL/MEMORY/cron，**先告诉我再动手**\n- 出方案时**附预计耗时**和**对 10 个 agent 的影响面**\n\n请先回我一份方案，再动一条。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":33,"output":685,"cacheRead":55991,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56709,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783086638287,"responseId":"0696f12e6393f0d30d2799aa42e3afd0","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
