{"type":"message","id":"ccf457f7","parentId":"bbcaffe2","timestamp":"2026-07-03T16:08:53.756Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]\n明白。HALEI 你累了就别想，直接让我指挥。\n\n**锁定一件事**：跑通\"**选品 → 数据分析 → 投流**\"全链路，给你看到完整结果。**发饰店 + 越南/泰国两个站点**为试点。\n\n我现在就开干，分工如下：\n\n| 阶段 | 主攻 | 给什么 |\n|------|------|--------|\n| 1. 选品 | tts | 5 个候选产品（结构化评分卡） |\n| 2. 数据分析 | director | 5 个候选的市场容量/竞品/差异化分析 |\n| 3. 投流方案 | traffic | 1 个最优品的广告投放方案（预算/定向/出价） |\n\n并行 30 分钟给你结果。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_74bi2kxg64yg_1","name":"update_plan","arguments":{"plan":[{"step":"选品：派 tts 出 5 个发饰候选（结构化评分卡）","status":"in_progress"},{"step":"数据分析：派 director 跑市场/竞品/差异化","status":"pending"},{"step":"投流：派 traffic 出一个最优品的完整广告方案","status":"pending"},{"step":"汇总交付：5 个候选 + 1 个投流方案，发到飞书","status":"pending"}]}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":6539,"output":349,"cacheRead":60146,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":67034,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783094927243,"responseId":"0697118fcf8bb834b83222971ff802a8","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
